  "name": "Grand Challenge",
  "alternateName": [
    "grand-challenge.org"
  ],
  "description": "Open-source Django/Docker platform for end-to-end development and deployment of medical imaging AI. Provides archives for managing DICOM data, reader studies for expert annotation, challenge hosting with automated leaderboards, and algorithm deployment for clinical validation. Used by 100,000+ researchers across radiology, pathology, ophthalmology, cardiology, and genomics. Hosts landmark benchmarks including CAMELYON, PANDA, PI-CAI, and TIGER. Self-hostable via Docker Compose; production instance operated by Radboud University Medical Center (DIAG Nijmegen). Apache 2.0, 189 stars, v2025.11.",
